    Recipe->>Recipe: compute.nextVersion
    Recipe->>Recipe: mutate.status
    Recipe->>Recipe: mutate.publishedAt
    Recipe->>Recipe: mutate.versionNumber
    Recipe->>EventBus: emit RecipeVersionRetracted on recipe.version_retracted
    Recipe-->>-Client: void